{
  "id": "108201",
  "resourceId": 82,
  "name": "麗塔",
  "skin": "預設",
  "spineVersion": "4.0",
  "skel": "c082_00.skel",
  "atlas": "c082_00.atlas",
  "defaultAnimation": "idle",
  "interactions": [
    {
      "id": "voice_01",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_01.mp3",
      "text": "非凡工具部隊乃全知全能之工具！",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_02",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_02.mp3",
      "text": "在海邊的非凡工具部隊也無所不能！",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_03",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_03.mp3",
      "text": "看到了嗎？\n我和伏特穿了同款衣服。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_04",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_04.mp3",
      "text": "這個小傢伙嗎？牠叫做伏特。你來看看，是不是超級可愛？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_05",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_05.mp3",
      "text": "既然來到海邊，我也讓伏特穿了件救生衣。\n小鬼你也一定要記得穿啊。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_06",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_06.mp3",
      "text": "要我穿得正式一點，\n所以穿了這套……\n奇怪的是看起來像個孩子，這讓我很在意。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_07",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_07.mp3",
      "text": "若你有物品需要製作或修理，可以隨時來找我。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_08",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_08.mp3",
      "text": "是誰把魚放到工具箱裡的！",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_09",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_09.mp3",
      "text": "不管穿什麼衣服，\n非凡工具部隊都是無所不能的！",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_10",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_10.mp3",
      "text": "幸好你這小鬼讀懂了我的心思。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_11",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_11.mp3",
      "text": "有生之年能來到海邊，真好啊。\n這都多虧了小鬼你吧？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_12",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_12.mp3",
      "text": "向日葵和伏特很像，所以我很喜歡向日葵。\n唔……這麼說來，小鬼你也和伏特長得很像呢。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_13",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_13.mp3",
      "text": "我想為你們留下美好的痕跡。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_14",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_14.mp3",
      "text": "人生漫長，世事難料。\n誰能想到，我居然有穿上泳裝的一天呢。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_15",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_15.mp3",
      "text": "你說我像幼稚園的小孩子……？\n你這傢伙～！！還不快收回你剛才的話！",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_16",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_16.mp3",
      "text": "一起陪伏特散散步吧？順便陪我說說話。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_17",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_17.mp3",
      "text": "小鬼，我們待會去撒網吧！\n我會捕一堆魚給你！",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_18",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_18.mp3",
      "text": "真是活得時間長了什麼都能見到啊。\n我這把年紀還能打扮成這樣。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_19",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時",
      "audio": "voices/voice_19.mp3",
      "text": "年紀輕輕，怎麼一副魂不守舍的樣子？還不快行動！",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_20",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時",
      "audio": "voices/voice_20.mp3",
      "text": "小鬼，你不去玩水，要一直在這裡發呆嗎？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_21",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時",
      "audio": "voices/voice_21.mp3",
      "text": "你忙的話我就先告辭了。\n我打算讓桑迪看看伏特的新衣服。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_22",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_22.mp3",
      "text": "小鬼，你這傢伙，有那閒時間還不快打掃一下房間！",
      "animation": "delight"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_23",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_23.mp3",
      "text": "好久沒有工作了，感覺有點奇怪呢。\n啊……這就是休閒活動吧。",
      "animation": "delight"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_24",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_24.mp3",
      "text": "穿著漂亮的衣服，總想多聊兩句。\n我要跟伏特一起玩了，等你有空了再過來。",
      "animation": "delight"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_25",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_25.mp3",
      "text": "啊～需要修理的地方太多，真叫人頭痛啊。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_26",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_26.mp3",
      "text": "游泳池好用嗎？\n有需要修理的地方嗎？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_27",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_27.mp3",
      "text": "伏特啊，既然穿上了新衣服，要去散步嗎？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_28",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_28.mp3",
      "text": "閒暇之餘，也常來我的工作坊玩吧，我們會一直在這裡的。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_29",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_29.mp3",
      "text": "夏天不愧是夏天～\n天氣變得好熱啊。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_30",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_30.mp3",
      "text": "穿成這樣去工作坊好像有點……不太合適。\n小鬼你覺得呢？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_31",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_31.mp3",
      "text": "真是個適合伏特嬉鬧玩耍的好地方呢。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_32",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_32.mp3",
      "text": "不過，這裡比地面的大海涼快多了。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_33",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_33.mp3",
      "text": "你問前哨基地有沒有幼稚園？\n不可能有吧。……不過你為什麼問這個？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_34",
      "category": "初次見面",
      "audio": "voices/voice_34.mp3",
      "text": "若是有需要的物件，可以告訴我，我隨時都能為你製作。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_35",
      "category": "初次見面",
      "audio": "voices/voice_35.mp3",
      "text": "要是想度過涼爽的夏天，你儘管開口。\n我什麼都可以做出來。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_36",
      "category": "初次見面",
      "audio": "voices/voice_36.mp3",
      "text": "穿成這樣確實有點難為情。\n不過我和伏特穿了同款，你不覺得很好看嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_37",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_37.mp3",
      "text": "嚯嚯……我都這把年紀了，居然也能成長。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_38",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_38.mp3",
      "text": "這樣補充體力就不會中暑了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_39",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_39.mp3",
      "text": "這次也勞你費心了。辛苦了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_40",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_40.mp3",
      "text": "真令人欣喜，我還寶刀未老啊。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_41",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_41.mp3",
      "text": "我有力氣踢著水游了，謝謝。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_42",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_42.mp3",
      "text": "累積了不少精力，應該能活得更久一點。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_43",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_43.mp3",
      "text": "……為何就是長不高了呢。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_44",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_44.mp3",
      "text": "大熱天的辛苦了，小鬼。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_45",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_45.mp3",
      "text": "小鬼，多虧了你，我享福了呢。謝謝。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_46",
      "category": "禮物I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_46.mp3",
      "text": "禮物……！我有多久都沒有收到了……！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_47",
      "category": "禮物I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_47.mp3",
      "text": "是禮物嗎？……謝謝。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_48",
      "category": "禮物I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_48.mp3",
      "text": "每次都這麼照顧我。謝謝你。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_49",
      "category": "禮物II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_49.mp3",
      "text": "你這小鬼，你能有多少錢……",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_50",
      "category": "禮物II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_50.mp3",
      "text": "這些是什麼時候準備的啊……！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_51",
      "category": "禮物II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_51.mp3",
      "text": "怎麼又準備了東西……\n要是我想要更多了，那可怎麼辦！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_52",
      "category": "禮物III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_52.mp3",
      "text": "為什麼要送這些？雖然說，還蠻讓人感動的……",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_53",
      "category": "禮物III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_53.mp3",
      "text": "我很高興你能照顧我……\n可是不要只照顧別人，也買點好東西給自己吧。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_54",
      "category": "禮物III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_54.mp3",
      "text": "感覺有點奇怪，你好像在送小孩子東西一樣……\n是我的錯覺吧？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_55",
      "category": "好感度提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_55.mp3",
      "text": "嗯……我都這把年紀了，還有如此情感，真是不錯呢。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_56",
      "category": "好感度提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_56.mp3",
      "text": "小鬼，今後也請多關照囉。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_57",
      "category": "好感度提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_57.mp3",
      "text": "小鬼，我正在製作準備送給你的伏特徽章。\n下次當作禮物送你。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_58",
      "category": "好感度提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_58.mp3",
      "text": "沒想到你這年輕小鬼也知道要敬老尊賢啊！",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_59",
      "category": "好感度提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_59.mp3",
      "text": "看來我確實跟小鬼你培養出感情了。\n我還想和你共度下一個夏天。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_60",
      "category": "好感度提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_60.mp3",
      "text": "小鬼，你要活得久一點。\n這樣我們才能長久一起生活。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_61",
      "category": "好感度提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_61.mp3",
      "text": "俗話說愛之深責之切，我對你也有相同的感情。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_62",
      "category": "好感度提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_62.mp3",
      "text": "小鬼，我覺得和你一起度過的夏天是最快樂的。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_63",
      "category": "好感度提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_63.mp3",
      "text": "糟糕。見面多了，感情也深了。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_64",
      "category": "編隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_64.mp3",
      "text": "雖說我在戰鬥上缺乏自信，但還是交給我吧！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_65",
      "category": "編隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_65.mp3",
      "text": "要去玩水？好，走吧！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_66",
      "category": "編隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_66.mp3",
      "text": "你要我穿這身衣服去打架嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_67",
      "category": "在野外點擊部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_67.mp3",
      "text": "稍候片刻啊。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_68",
      "category": "在野外點擊部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_68.mp3",
      "text": "你叫我？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_69",
      "category": "在野外點擊部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_69.mp3",
      "text": "說吧。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_70",
      "category": "在野外移動部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_70.mp3",
      "text": "伏特啊，我們走吧。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_71",
      "category": "在野外移動部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_71.mp3",
      "text": "玩個水好辛苦啊。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_72",
      "category": "在野外移動部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_72.mp3",
      "text": "穿成這樣跑過去很吃力啊。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_73",
      "category": "進入戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_73.mp3",
      "text": "呃……！要戰鬥了……！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_74",
      "category": "進入戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_74.mp3",
      "text": "嗯……果然不順利。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_75",
      "category": "進入戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_75.mp3",
      "text": "唔……果然不能輕鬆通過啊……！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_76",
      "category": "開始戰鬥I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_76.mp3",
      "text": "嗯，我定當竭盡全力。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_77",
      "category": "開始戰鬥I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_77.mp3",
      "text": "嗯。儘管天氣炎熱，但一定會成功的。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_78",
      "category": "開始戰鬥I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_78.mp3",
      "text": "既然如此，快點結束戰鬥回去吧！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_79",
      "category": "開始戰鬥II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_79.mp3",
      "text": "伏特啊，你要跟緊我喔。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_80",
      "category": "開始戰鬥II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_80.mp3",
      "text": "伏特，我們趕快結束戰鬥去看海吧。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_81",
      "category": "開始戰鬥II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_81.mp3",
      "text": "伏特啊，新衣服新氣象，展現我們的全新實力吧！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_82",
      "category": "開始戰鬥III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_82.mp3",
